  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>Still in the field, in the tunnels dug into the night side where the band&#39;s households retreat when the cold quarter comes round. The study is meant to establish whether the warren is a refuge, a store or a second settlement, and the answer so far appears to be that the question belongs to the survey rather than to anybody living there. It has produced a full plan of seven entrances and a household-by-household record of who goes down and when. Its two senior members have shared postings since 2264 and have filed separate progress reports for every year of this one.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
    }
